      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `f11400a99f9fed7db26a922a5462d2e4ff39a794c6e3bcf934baf08f6d8d3a7c--criminal-courts-australia-tables-1-to-7-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2013-14\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"List of tables\" | 0655d782e07bd3a9b0cc055ef14e478d6989f2f4d777f89ece2c729e06ec60c7 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | ec97362c41cc1fdffccdb08cca8b3b705abee2555592833ccfd7dfc9bb1f38c0 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | cbcbcefb2b200680f0e0bde30f21f168c951d613256768177d94d6a4dbc29332 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 509083793eaffcbd9718a148f62b7ded6d25c008e906f4192b77ce22d898ff21 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 9c256a10fae9e44a1a145b223fc846c16d65388dc6df498d3d508b7a6439dc10 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | 09e62945285adbc1d66fc3f0b2115736b5be6c774660b8a2d69b48002c680a0b | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 216fcf35d936d7a97dae956473b31df84ed219eabd8f89c2b328940a1d15aa23 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 39780c5d6e48b9b6b22e83b5a73dd773f46f08b1f6806ebdf8b4c53fd122109c | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
